| Q1 | P gate | **conditional** | `.05` + full CE + both CIs + step0/step100 closes vacuousness for binary validity; residual: gate catches full destruction, partial erosion (e.g. Δcopy 0.3 → P_RETENTION≈0.08 passes) is only visible via descriptive P_RETENTION — must be documented pre-results |
| Q2 | PA arm | **conditional** | Native+adapter+LoRA correctly separates the adapter soft-prompt confound (`Adapter(512,512)` dim-compatible); but PA-vs-P comparison unoperationalized ("크게 잃으면" undefined) and M_VALID must require P_VALID ∧ PA_VALID ∧ P/PA M pass |
