| Q4 | Mean-memory | **conditional** | Train-only/len≥K/eligible≥10/P·PA validation adequate; missing: M_NORM zero-norm guard, m_eligible=false exclusion-rate report, permutation/perturbation invariance executed; M_NORM uses target real-memory norm → must be disclosed as scale-matching |
