| Q9 | P/PA/M tests | **agree** | 8 required test families: structure/64-module, seed reproducibility (manual_seed before LoRA init), mode parity extension, M leakage, M invariance+guards, native-path CE==built-in, documents_positive separation, donor duplicate exclusion, synthetic label-engine tests |
