### Must-fix (ranked, before implementation & 1-seed debug)
1. **Label precedence + missing cells** frozen pre-results (synthetic unit-testable)
2. **PA gate integration**: PA_VALID into M_VALID premises; PA_RETENTION defined; ADAPTER_SOFT_PROMPT_RISK descriptive field
3. **M_NORM zero-norm guard** + exclusion-rate/real-vs-mean-norm artifacts + target-norm disclosure
4. **Cap measurement definition** (wall vs CPU-hours) + per-phase timing artifacts, no auto-extension
5. **Code-contract tests** frozen pre-implementation (documents_positive split, set_training_mode P/PA, seeding order, donor duplicate exclusion, leakage/invariance)

